I don't usually do long posts, but I wanted to thank the @SuperteamSG community for banding together to help make Solana Summit a success :)

Solana Summit had 7K+ builders and traders from 110+ countries signup, and generated 2.3M+ impressions from 2.3K+ posts on X. But just two months ago, we had no sponsors and no sign-ups. 

That's when the community stepped in to help and became our first believers.

@nansen_ai doesn't usually do booths, but they trusted our idea for doing an interactive trading personality quiz. Thank you Ingrid and @ASvanevik

@MeteoraAG's trading game and protein drinks were a highlight, with long queues all day. Claps to @0xmiir, @0x_Malc, @pranave and @dannxbt!

@SafePal designed a limited-edition Solana Summit wallet on a crazy tight timeline and gave them out as prizes. Thank you @CheongCJ1, @V_SafePal and Dada!

@sanctumso hosted their VIP happy hour inside the summit. Thank you @eggpanned, @soleconomist and team!

@traded_gg gave so many people their first-ever Pokémon card opening experience.

And when I complained coffee was too expensive, @JupiterExchange sponsored it. Thanks @eleesatt!

And then the circle kept widening:
@SuperteamKZ introduced us to @kase_kz (Kazakhstan Stock Exchange), who were super cool and nothing like the boring TradFi folks I'd imagined.
@decentra1ized_ introduced us to @KoreaPanda_ from @ZetaChain, and we got to be part of their Solana launch!
@Helius and @debridge sponsored the VIP brunch and lounge. Thank you @bradyowen, @Sherrypeter and @EmsleyJonnie!
@SuperteamMY rallied Superteams across the region and turned the summit into a real Solana APAC gathering. Thank you @tuakdotsol :)

No one just came to just network. Everyone pitched in to make this a success. @shizudio agreed to MC last min, @yx3142 giving us free discounts for solana summit @OnchainAditi helping out with the hectic ops, and the superteam community members just helped out at every step along the way whether its inviting ppl or sharing on socials. 

And most importantly, thank you @0xSoju and @xianxlb. Two months ago they asked me, "Kimmi, how important is this summit to you?" I said "100%." And the rest is history. They've just been all in ever since, pulling many late night shifts together and helping out all the way. 

Solana Summit was truly built together, as a community, as an ecosystem, and I'm so grateful to have been part of it 💜

